{"id":"t71524","key":"l as des as|1982","csv":{"title":"L'As des as","year":1982,"directors":["Gérard Oury"],"rating":5,"watchedDate":"2023-03-30"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":71524,"imdbId":"tt0083580","wikidataId":"Q560800","title":"L'As des as","originalTitle":"L'As des as","altTitles":["Ас на асовете","Aas der azen","O Ás dos Ases","As asova","Alle tiders flugt","Ässien ässä","O assos ton asson","Den elleville flukten","As","Asul asilor","Das As der Asse","Ace of Aces"],"tagline":"","overview":"À l’occasion des Jeux Olympiques de Berlin de 1936, Georges dit « Jo », entraîneur de l’équipe française de boxe se rend en train dans la capitale accompagné de ses « poulains ». Il est abordé par un gosse de dix ans, Karl, un petit juif, qui le suit partout pour obtenir un autographe…","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"1982-10-27","runtime":100,"status":"Released","genres":["Aventure","Comédie"],"genreIds":[12,35],"countries":["France","Germany"],"originCountry":["FR"],"languages":["Français"],"originalLanguage":"fr","directors":["Gérard Oury"],"directorIds":[11195],"writers":["Gérard Oury","Danièle Thompson"],"composers":["Vladimir Cosma"],"cinematographers":["Xaver Schwarzenberger"],"editors":["Albert Jurgenson"],"producers":["Jean-Paul Belmondo","Alain Poiré","Horst Wendlandt"],"cast":[{"id":3829,"name":"Jean-Paul Belmondo","character":"Jo Cavalier","profilePath":"/hXAM7zTXGWVAv0VLGGrnxAJJbca.jpg"},{"id":3536,"name":"Marie-France Pisier","character":"Gaby Delcourt","profilePath":"/uSSMHQ6rAmo06qp6HYuLE5YS46T.jpg"},{"id":146217,"name":"Rachid Ferrache","character":"Simon Rosenblum","profilePath":"/jEyrSd8aBv9VZWaZmzQDk7h9F6a.jpg"},{"id":240515,"name":"Frank Hoffmann","character":"Gunther von Beckman","profilePath":"/mFl8VTg3A2W8eF4ppsBbaTjNHFu.jpg"},{"id":3617,"name":"Günter Meisner","character":"Adolf Hitler / Angela Hitler","profilePath":"/ibAOPFB4cD61IG8zVDjepk2w3El.jpg"},{"id":50089,"name":"Benno Sterzenbach","character":"Major Aschbach, Gestapo officer","profi